The voice prompts in lang/fr/ were synthesised with Kyutai TTS 1.6B
(https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-1.6b-en_fr, weights CC BY 4.0, (c) Kyutai)
using the voice embedding cml-tts/fr/5476_3103_000072-0001_enhanced.wav
from https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-voices (CML-TTS dataset (https://openslr.org/146/), CC BY 4.0).
